{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 04 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">视觉 Transformer：全局交互、层级窗口与高分辨率代价</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision Transformers</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_022_swin_transformer-title\">Swin Transformer</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">W-MSA 与 SW-MSA 交替实现局部高效注意力和跨窗连接，并以 patch merging 形成层次金字塔。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Alternates regular Windowed Multi-Head Self-Attention (W-MSA) with Shifted-Window Attention (SW-MSA) across a patch-merging multi-scale pyramid.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">二维图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2D image (or 3D volume in Video/3D Swin)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">四级层次化特征金字塔或任务预测</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Four-stage multi-scale hierarchical feature pyramid or task predictions</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2021/html/Liu_Swin_Transformer_Hierarchical_Vision_Transformer_Using_Shifted_Windows_ICCV_2021_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_022_swin_transformer')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_022_swin_transformer')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Swin Transformer original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/d2ada49b01272180aba7.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_022_swin_transformer', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_022_swin_transformer\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_022_swin_transformer')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_022_swin_transformer', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_022_swin_transformer\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">以 4×4 patch 为基本单元建立高分辨率 token 网格。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image (or 3d volume in video/3d swin) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"以 4×4 patch 为基本单元建立高分辨率 token 网格。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 2d image (or 3d volume in video/3d swin) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Input Image\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_022_swin_transformer', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">以 4×4 patch 为基本单元建立高分辨率 token 网格。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image (or 3d volume in video/3d swin) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"相邻像素块映射为 C 维 token，保留二维布局。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Patch embedding to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Patch 嵌入\" data-node-name-en=\"Patch embedding\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_022_swin_transformer', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Patch 嵌入</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Patch embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">相邻像素块映射为 C 维 token，保留二维布局。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Patch embedding to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"特征被切成 M×M 非重叠局部窗口。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 03 within the core hierarchical shifted window transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"窗口划分\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 03\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_022_swin_transformer', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">窗口划分</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 03</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">特征被切成 M×M 非重叠局部窗口。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 03 within the core hierarchical shifted window transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"注意力只在各局部窗口内部计算，复杂度相对图像大小近似线性。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs W-MSA within the core hierarchical shifted window transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"W-MSA\" data-node-name-en=\"W-MSA\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_022_swin_transformer', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>W-MSA</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">注意力只在各局部窗口内部计算，复杂度相对图像大小近似线性。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs W-MSA within the core hierarchical shifted window transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"下一 block 将窗口平移 M/2，并用 attention mask 保持有效边界。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs + Mask within the core hierarchical shifted window transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"循环移位 + Mask\" data-node-name-en=\"+ Mask\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_022_swin_transformer', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">循环移位 + Mask</span><span class=\"lang-en\">+ Mask</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">下一 block 将窗口平移 M/2，并用 attention mask 保持有效边界。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs + Mask within the core hierarchical shifted window transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"移位窗口让上一层不同窗口的 token 在本层直接交互。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs SW-MSA within the core hierarchical shifted window transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"SW-MSA\" data-node-name-en=\"SW-MSA\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_022_swin_transformer', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>SW-MSA</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">移位窗口让上一层不同窗口的 token 在本层直接交互。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs SW-MSA within the core hierarchical shifted window transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"拼接 2×2 邻域并线性投影；分辨率减半、通道增宽。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Patch Merging within the core hierarchical shifted window transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Patch Merging\" data-node-name-en=\"Patch Merging\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_022_swin_transformer', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Patch Merging</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">拼接 2×2 邻域并线性投影；分辨率减半、通道增宽。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Patch Merging within the core hierarchical shifted window transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"重复 W-MSA/SW-MSA 对并逐级下采样，形成 CNN 式层次结构。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Stage to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"四级 Stage\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_022_swin_transformer', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">四级 Stage</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">重复 W-MSA/SW-MSA 对并逐级下采样，形成 CNN 式层次结构。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Stage to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"各 stage 特征可送入分类头、检测 FPN 或分割 decoder。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces four-stage multi-scale hierarchical feature pyramid or task predictions via multi-scale output.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"多尺度输出\" data-node-name-en=\"multi-scale output\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_022_swin_transformer', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多尺度输出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multi-scale output</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">各 stage 特征可送入分类头、检测 FPN 或分割 decoder。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces four-stage multi-scale hierarchical feature pyramid or task predictions via multi-scale output.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Swin Transformer Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 移位窗口注意力实现跨窗口通信</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Shifted-Window Partitioning for Linear-Complexity Cross-Window Exchange</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Swin Transformer：核心公式 · 移位窗口注意力实现跨窗口通信\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\"