ef=\"#m022_g17-77\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"43.534952\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g17-83\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"48.725479\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g17-65\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"56.41664\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g7-185\" y=\"-60.002514\"></use><use x=\"60.132699\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g17-83\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"65.671924\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g17-104\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"70.653244\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g17-105\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"73.422857\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g17-102\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"76.740418\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g17-116\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"80.018122\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g7-185\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"84.28213\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g10-45\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"91.15136\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g7-186\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"94.967036\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g17-59\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"99.895182\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g10-34\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"108.144248\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g14-97\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"111.373343\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g14-116\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"113.395161\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g14-116\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"115.416979\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g14-110\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"119.551438\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g7-186\" y=\"-60.002514\"></use><use x=\"123.367082\" xlink:href=\"#m022_g7-186\" y=\"-60.002514\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">ViT 单尺度且全局注意力在高分辨率图像上二次增长</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Isotropic ViT maintains a single coarse token resolution and scales quadratically with image area, hindering dense segmentation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在局部窗口做注意力并通过 shifted windows 和 patch merging 建层级特征</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Restrict self-attention to local non-overlapping windows for linear scaling, shifting window boundaries between consecutive layers to bridge context.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">固定窗口近线性计算、跨窗传播与 CNN 式多尺度金字塔</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Alternating W-MSA / SW-MSA, relative position bias, and 2×2 patch merging producing a CNN-like multi-scale hierarchy.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">广泛用于 2D/3D 医学分割、检测和 Swin UNETR</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Core backbone for Swin UNETR, TransMorph, MARS, and high-resolution 2D/3D medical dense prediction.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">层级 Transformer 长期有价值；窗口与 patch 尺度仍是新超参数</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Enduring hierarchical Transformer standard; window size and anisotropic voxel spacing require careful tuning.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">局部窗口把全局 N² attention 化为随像素数近似线性增长的窗口注意力。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">交替的常规窗口与移位窗口在不增加窗口大小的前提下实现跨窗口通信。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">patch merging 构造从细纹理到高语义的金字塔，使 Transformer 能原生服务密集预测。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Restrict self-attention to local non-overlapping windows for linear scaling, shifting window boundaries between consecutive layers to bridge context.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Alternating W-MSA / SW-MSA, relative position bias, and 2×2 patch merging producing a CNN-like multi-scale hierarchy.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Shifted-Window Partitioning for Linear-Complexity Cross-Window Exchange.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">窗口机制适合高分辨率 CT/MR/病理图，但窗口边界和下采样仍可能削弱极小病灶。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">层次特征可直接接 U-Net 式 decoder；三维实现需把窗口、移位与相对位置偏置扩展到 D×H×W。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Core backbone for Swin UNETR, TransMorph, MARS, and high-resolution 2D/3D medical dense prediction.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Enduring hierarchical Transformer standard; window size and anisotropic voxel spacing require careful tuning.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2021/html/Liu_Swin_Transformer_Hierarchical_Vision_Transformer_Using_Shifted_Windows_ICCV_2021_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Swin Transformer: Hierarchical Vision Transformer using Shifted Windows</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/Swin-Transformer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
